1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:03,120
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Victoria and Linda are sisters.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,440
Their parents make them wash dishes.

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,840
They take turns.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,300
Victoria washes the dishes on Monday, Wednesday, and

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:14,720
Friday.

6
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:20,300
Linda washes the dishes on Tuesday, Thursday, and

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:20,760
Saturday.

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,180
On Sunday, they flip a coin.

9
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:28,820
Today, it was Victoria's turn to wash dishes.

10
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,080
Linda took advantage of this.

11
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,660
She used three dishes at dinner.

12
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:39,640
She had one dish for rice, one dish

13
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,560
for meat, and another dish for dessert.

14
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,920
Why do you have to make me wash

15
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:46,340
more?

16
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,040
Victoria yelled.

17
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:51,120
It's fair, Linda said.

18
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,460
Victoria never did that to Linda.

19
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:58,500
She planned to make Linda wash more dishes

20
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,100
tomorrow.
